# BLOCKED — Human Intervention Required

> **Notice**: When this file exists (renamed to `BLOCKED.md`), the autonomous Ralph loop immediately halts to prevent spinning or hallucinating placeholder data.

## Blocker Summary
- **Attempted Task**: Description of the task being executed.
- **Blocker Encountered**: Exact missing secret, API credential, or hardware barrier.

## Required Human Action
1. Supply required credential or resolve environmental barrier.
2. Delete `BLOCKED.md`.
3. Re-run `./ralph.sh` (or `./ralph.sh --loop`).
